    380  f1bf							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    381  f1bf							; TitleSelect — MOVED to bank1 (refactor_v4_plan Phase 3.1 canary, 2026-10-16).
    382  f1bf							; Entered via CallPad_TitleSelect ($FC4F); returns C=1 edge / C=0 no-edge.
    383  f1bf
    384  f1bf
    385  f1bf							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    386  f1bf							; TitleIntro — intro-screen ($FD) edge check. Entered by JMP from DropStep
    387  f1bf							; (no pending return; tail-jumps out — never rts, or it would pop a stale
    388  f1bf							; frame return). Any SELECT/RESET press (level-triggered, prev-released via
    389  f1bf							; StepsLeft): DropTarget=$FF (old title) + jsr DropArm (.DATitle pose/score
    390  f1bf							; — the room is ALREADY loaded from boot LoadLevel, no deep LoadLevel:
    391  f1bf							; stack depth DropStep→TitleIntro→DropArm keeps sim_bomb_fuse min-SP).
    392  f1bf							; Always re-samples StepsLeft (title-owned on intro/title frames;
    393  f1bf							; RefreshEnemyY's idle-only guard never touches it during gameplay... its
    394  f1bf							; gameplay latch writes StepsLeft only when DropTarget==0 — intro frames
    395  f1bf							; have DropTarget=$FD so ownership stays clean).
