   1134  f6cf							; returns late in its line, and 12 cycles of index code there cost a whole
   1135  f6cf							; scanline (frames 273, 2026-10-27). Both patterns come straight from tables
   1136  f6cf							; indexed by the lives count, written right after the HMOVE (P1 at X 44 draws
   1137  f6cf							; from colour clock 112 = cycle 37, so the GRP writes must land before it).
